          tutor:[
            {h:`Who reads it?`, p:`<p>Outside = letter. Inside = memo.</p>`},
            {h:`How it opens and closes`, p:`<p>Letter: address, Dear..., Yours... Memo: TO/FROM/DATE/SUBJECT, initials.</p>`}
          ],
